<script setup lang="ts">import {ref,onMounted,computed,watch} from 'vue';import {useRoute} from 'vue-router';import {useResearch} from '../stores/research';import {useTask} from '../hooks/useTask';import {usePolling} from '../hooks/usePolling';import {number,probability} from '../utils/format';import PageHeading from '../components/common/PageHeading.vue';import ErrorNotice from '../components/common/ErrorNotice.vue';import EmptyState from '../components/common/EmptyState.vue';import StatusBadge from '../components/common/StatusBadge.vue';import InteractionPlot from '../components/InteractionPlot.vue';import RunSummary from '../components/RunSummary.vue';const route=useRoute(),lab=useResearch(),selected=ref(Number(route.query.run)||0),{error,perform}=useTask();const run=computed(()=>lab.runs.find(r=>r.id===selected.value));onMounted(()=>perform(async()=>{await lab.load();if(!selected.value)selected.value=lab.runs.find(r=>r.status==='completed')?.id||lab.runs[0]?.id||0;}));watch(()=>route.query.run,v=>{if(v)selected.value=Number(v);});usePolling(async()=>{if(run.value&&['queued','running'].includes(run.value.status))await lab.load();});</script><template><PageHeading index="04" title="因子平均与条件差异，放在一起解释" text="交互有统计证据时，简单效应帮助定位条件差异，主效应保留平均口径。"><RouterLink class="outline" :to="'/plans?run='+selected">提出后续实验 ↗</RouterLink></PageHeading><ErrorNotice :message="error" @retry="perform(lab.load)"/><div class="run-selector"><label>分析记录<select v-model="selected"><option v-for="r in lab.runs" :key="r.id" :value="r.id">#{{r.id}} {{r.name}}</option></select></label><StatusBadge v-if="run" :status="run.status"/></div><template v-if="run?.status==='completed'"><div class="result-hero"><InteractionPlot :run="run"/><RunSummary :run="run"/></div><section class="anova-section"><div class="section-heading"><h2>固定效应ANOVA</h2><span>校正总SS分解残差 {{number(run.result.ss_partition_error,10)}}</span></div><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>来源</th><th>SS</th><th>df</th><th>MS</th><th>F</th><th>p</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr v-for="row in run.result.anova" :key="row.term" :class="{highlight:row.term==='AB'}"><td>{{row.label}}</td><td>{{number(row.ss,5)}}</td><td>{{row.df}}</td><td>{{number(row.ms,5)}}</td><td>{{number(row.f,5)}}</td><td>{{probability(row.p)}}</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section class="contrast-section"><div class="section-heading"><h2>全部预设简单效应 / {{run.result.family_size}}项</h2><span>差值方向：左水平 − 右水平</span></div><p class="interval-note">以下为{{Math.round((1-run.alpha)*100)}}%同方差逐项t区间，未作家族同时覆盖校正；拒绝结论依据同一家族的Holm校正p值。</p><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>固定条件</th><th>对比方向</th><th>差值MPa</th><th>SE</th><th>t</th><th>原始p</th><th>Holm p</th><th>逐项t区间</th><th>家族结论</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr v-for="c in run.result.contrasts" :key="c.index"><td>{{c.condition_factor}}={{c.condition}}</td><td>{{c.left}} − {{c.right}}</td><td>{{number(c.estimate,4)}}</td><td>{{number(c.se,4)}}</td><td>{{number(c.t,3)}}</td><td>{{probability(c.p_raw)}}</td><td>{{probability(c.p_holm)}}</td><td>{{number(c.ci_low,3)}} — {{number(c.ci_high,3)}}</td><td :class="c.reject_holm?'positive':'muted'">{{c.reject_holm?'拒绝零差异':'未拒绝'}}</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><p class="assumption-note">正态残差、独立观测与同方差是分析前提；本页没有自动证明这些前提成立。显著性不等同工艺重要性或量产结论。</p><p class="fingerprint">INPUT SHA256 / {{run.result.fingerprint}}</p></template><EmptyState v-else :title="run?.status==='failed'?'当前分析不可估':'等待完整因子计算'" :text="run?.error||'请选择一份完成的记录，或先提交完整平衡设计。运行状态会自动刷新。'"/></template>
